=== ana: step 40000 of 53880 (74.239% of its plan) ===
## User

Divide two integers, returning Nothing when the divisor is zero.

## Type

type
```haskell
safeDiv :: Int -> Int -> Maybe Int
```

## Term

```haskell
safeDiv x y
  | x == 0    = Nothing
  | y == 0    = Nothing
  | otherwise = Just (x `div` y)
```

